<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Nupcias - Tu boda, tu estilo</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400..700;1,400..700&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Cinzel:wght@600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    .font-serif { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; }
    .font-sans { font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; }
    .font-cinzel { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-stone-950 text-stone-100 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between selection:bg-stone-800 selection:text-white">

  <header class="w-full py-6 px-8 flex justify-between items-center border-b border-stone-800/80 backdrop-blur-md">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-xl">💍</span>
      <span class="font-cinzel tracking-[0.25em] text-xs font-bold uppercase text-stone-200">Nupcias</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
      <button onclick="toggleHomeAdminModal()" class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400 hover:text-white transition font-sans border border-stone-800 px-4 py-2 rounded-full cursor-pointer">
        🔑 Admin
      </button>
      <a href="/crear" class="bg-stone-100 text-stone-950 px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase hover:bg-stone-300 transition shadow-lg cursor-pointer">Crear Invitación</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Modal Admin Inicio -->
  <div id="homeAdminModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 p-8 rounded-3xl max-w-sm w-full shadow-2xl text-center font-sans">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold mb-2 text-white">Panel de Administración</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 mb-6">Ingresa el enlace o slug de tu boda y tu PIN de seguridad:</p>
      <form onsubmit="irAAdmin(event)" class="space-y-4 text-left">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 mb-1">Enlace / Slug de la Boda</label>
          <input type="text" id="adminSlug" required placeholder="ej. maria-miguel-1234" class="w-full p-3 bg-stone-950 border border-stone-800 rounded-xl text-xs text-white">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 mb-1">PIN de Seguridad</label>
          <input type="password" id="adminPin" maxlength="4" required placeholder="PIN (ej. 1234)" class="w-full p-3 bg-stone-950 border border-stone-800 rounded-xl text-xs text-white text-center tracking-widest">
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2 pt-2">
          <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-stone-100 text-stone-950 py-3 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider cursor-pointer hover:bg-white transition">Entrar</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="toggleHomeAdminModal()" class="w-full bg-stone-800 text-stone-300 py-3 rounded-xl text-xs cursor-pointer hover:bg-stone-700 transition">Cancelar</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    function toggleHomeAdminModal() {
      document.getElementById('homeAdminModal').classList.toggle('hidden');
    }
    function irAAdmin(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      const slug = document.getElementById('adminSlug').value.trim();
      const pin = document.getElementById('adminPin').value.trim();
      // Redirigir enviando el pin por POST o usando login directo
      const form = document.createElement('form');
      form.method = 'POST';
      form.action = `/boda/${slug}/admin-login`;
      const input = document.createElement('input');
      input.type = 'hidden';
      input.name = 'pin';
      input.value = pin;
      form.appendChild(input);
      document.body.appendChild(form);
      form.submit();
    }
  </script>

  <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 text-center space-y-12">
    <div class="space-y-5 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-stone-400 font-medium">Plataforma de Invitaciones Digitales de Lujo</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight">Tu boda, tu estilo</h1>
      <p class="text-stone-400 text-sm md:text-base font-light leading-relaxed">Crea invitaciones interactivas memorables con sobres animados, doble tipografía elegante, galería dinámica en abanico, mesa de regalos internacional y control de asistencia.</p>
      <div class="pt-4">
        <a href="/crear" class="inline-block bg-stone-100 text-stone-950 px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-white transition shadow-2xl cursor-pointer">Diseñar Mi Invitación Ahora</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-10 text-left">
      <div class="bg-stone-900/60 p-6 rounded-3xl border border-stone-800/80 backdrop-blur-md space-y-3 shadow-xl">
        <span class="text-2xl">🌿</span>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold">Minimalismo Orgánico</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">Estética pulida y natural, ideal para ceremonias íntimas y celebraciones al aire libre.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-stone-900/60 p-6 rounded-3xl border border-stone-800/80 backdrop-blur-md space-y-3 shadow-xl">
        <span class="text-2xl">⚜️</span>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold">Elegancia Imperial</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">Detalles en relieve, sellos de cera personalizados y fuentes de alta costura nupcial.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-stone-900/60 p-6 rounded-3xl border border-stone-800/80 backdrop-blur-md space-y-3 shadow-xl">
        <span class="text-2xl">✨</span>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold">Vanguardia Interactiva</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">Galerías inmersivas en abanico, música de fondo y pasarela de regalos digitales.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="py-6 border-t border-stone-900 text-center text-xs text-stone-500">
    <p>Nupcias © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Todos los derechos reservados</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
